{% doc %}
  Shipping and delivery page for Signs ByLITA.
{% enddoc %}
<article class="sbl-info">
  {% render 'sbl-info-hero',
    eyebrow: 'Fulfillment',
    title: 'Shipping &amp; delivery',
    text: 'Customized in the US. Shipped to all 50 states. No surprises.',
    aside_label: '',
    aside_text: ''
  %}
  <div class="sbl-info-body">
    <h2>Production time</h2>
    <p>Every custom sign, desk sign and plaque is personalized with your wording. Once your order is placed, our team starts on it right away. Most orders are customized, quality-checked and shipped within 2 business days. Ready-made signs often ship the same day.</p>
    <p>Large orders, such as a full set of signs for a building, may need extra production time. If you have a deadline, contact us before you order and we'll do our best to meet it.</p>

    <h2>Shipping options</h2>
    <div class="sbl-info-table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Method</th>
            <th>Estimated delivery</th>
            <th>Notes</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Standard shipping</td>
            <td>3–5 business days</td>
            <td>Available on all orders</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Expedited shipping</td>
            <td>2 business days</td>
            <td>Available at checkout</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Overnight shipping</td>
            <td>Next business day</td>
            <td>Available at checkout</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="sbl-info-note">Delivery times are counted from the day your order ships, not the day it is placed. Production time is separate.</p>

    <h2>Shipping costs</h2>
    <p>Shipping costs are calculated at checkout based on your order size, weight and destination. Free standard shipping is available on qualifying orders — the threshold is shown in your cart and at checkout.</p>

    <h2>Order tracking</h2>
    <p>As soon as your order ships, you'll receive a confirmation email with a tracking number so you can follow your package with the carrier.</p>
    <p>Haven't received a shipping confirmation within 3 business days of ordering? Check your spam folder first — then contact us and we'll look into it right away.</p>

    <h2>Delivery area</h2>
    <p>We currently ship to all 50 U.S. states. We don't offer international shipping at the moment. If you're outside the U.S. and need signs, contact us to discuss options.</p>

    <h2>Damaged or lost packages</h2>
    <h3>Damaged on arrival?</h3>
    <p>Contact us within 7 days of delivery with a photo of the damage and we'll send a replacement.</p>
    <h3>Package lost in transit?</h3>
    <p>Contact us and we'll work with the carrier to find your shipment, or send a replacement if needed.</p>

    <h2>Bulk and business orders</h2>
    <p>Signing a whole building, or shipping to several locations? For large orders that need freight shipping, scheduled delivery or drop-shipping to multiple sites, contact us and we'll arrange it.</p>

    <div class="sbl-info-actions">
      <span>Ready to order?</span>
      <a class="sbl-info-btn sbl-info-btn--gold" href="/products/custom-sign">Design your sign now</a>
      <a class="sbl-info-btn sbl-info-btn--ghost" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Shop ready-made signs</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
